## ChatMessageContentEntity

**Namespace**: `Cyrena.Models`
**Assembly**: `Cyrena.Core`

### Purpose
Used to persist chat history to storage. Wraps `Microsoft.SemanticKernel.ChatCompletion.ChatMessageContent` with additional metadata for persistence.

### ChatMessageContentEntity
```csharp
public sealed class ChatMessageContentEntity : Entity
{
    public ChatMessageContentEntity();
    public ChatMessageContentEntity(ChatMessageContent content, Ulid? iterationId = null);

    public Ulid? IterationId { get; set; }
    public DateTime Date { get; set; }
    public string? Role { get; set; }
    public List<KernelContentEntity> Items { get; set; }
    public string? ModelId { get; set; }
    public IReadOnlyDictionary<string, object?>? Metadata { get; set; }
    public string? MimeType { get; set; }

    public ChatMessageContent AsChatMessage();
}
```

### Properties
| Property | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| `IterationId` | `Ulid?` | ID of the iteration this message belongs to |
| `Date` | `DateTime` | When the message was created |
| `Role` | `string?` | Message role label (e.g., "user", "assistant", "system") |
| `Items` | `List<KernelContentEntity>` | Content items wrapped in KernelContentEntity |
| `ModelId` | `string?` | Model ID used to generate the content |
| `Metadata` | `IReadOnlyDictionary<string, object?>?` | Additional metadata |
| `MimeType` | `string?` | MIME type of the content |

### KernelContentEntity
```csharp
public sealed class KernelContentEntity : Entity
{
    public KernelContentEntity();
    public KernelContentEntity(KernelContent item);

    public KernelContent? Item { get; set; }
    public bool IsContentType<TKernelContent>() where TKernelContent : KernelContent;
}
```

### Methods

#### AsChatMessage()
Converts the entity back to a `ChatMessageContent` for use with Semantic Kernel.

```csharp
public ChatMessageContent AsChatMessage()
```

### Usage
```csharp
// Create from chat message
var entity = new ChatMessageContentEntity(chatMessageContent, iterationId);

// Convert back
var message = entity.AsChatMessage();
```

### Related
- `IChatMessageService` - Uses ChatMessageContentEntity for persistence
- `IStore<ChatMessageContentEntity>` - Persistence store
- `KernelContent` - Semantic Kernel content base class
- `ChatMessageContent` - Semantic Kernel chat message type
